          </a>
          <a href="/contact-whispering-pines-resort-mukteshwar/#distance-matrix" class="block hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors group leading-snug">
            🚗 <strong class="text-[#FAF9F6] group-hover:text-[#c9a832]">Lucknow to Resort Near Mukteshwar:</strong> 380 km • 7.5h
          </a>
          <a href="/contact-whispering-pines-resort-mukteshwar/#distance-matrix" class="block hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors group leading-snug">
            🚗 <strong class="text-[#FAF9F6] group-hover:text-[#c9a832]">Chandigarh to Mukteshwar / Nainital:</strong> 420 km • 8.5h
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Transit Hubs & Secondary Metros */}
        <div class="pt-2.5 border-t border-[#FAF9F6]/10 space-y-1 text-[11px] text-[#FAF9F6]/75">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#c9a832] block font-semibold">
            Rail & Air Gateways
          </span>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            🚆 <strong class="text-[#FAF9F6]">Kathgodam to Resort (KGM):</strong> 43 km • 1.5 hrs<br/>
            ✈️ <strong class="text-[#FAF9F6]">Pantnagar to Resort (PGH):</strong> 76 km • 2.5 hrs
          </p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-[#FAF9F6]/60 pt-0.5 font-mono">
